    "description": "MobiCT is a Nextflow pipeline built on nf-core guidelines that detects ultra-low-frequency variants in cell-free DNA using unique molecular identifiers, via UMI deduplication, alignment to a reference genome, and variant calling; it was validated on cancer patient and control samples with ~90% sensitivity, precision, and F1-score.",
